    "description": "1. Developed high performance data ingestion systems to get data into Splunk -- the leading big data analytic system in the market. Led a team to design the HTTP event collector that has become the most efficient way to ingest data into Splunk. It’s ranked as the most innovative feature in Splunk in 2015.\n\n2. Developed the Splunk ODBC driver to expose Splunk data to SQL clients. This feature is highly rated by analysts and is the foundation for the Tableau and Splunk Strategic Technology Alliance.\n\n3. Made Splunk stable and performant on Windows. Redesigned key components in Splunk to work better on Windows. As the result of this work, the percentage of Splunk customers on Windows platform increased from below 10% to over 60% in 3 years.\n",
